Rule 1 (scale tensor must have dimension 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1
>>
Rule 2 (number of elements in scales and zero_points must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 3 (valid axis for per-channel quantization)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 7 (valid scale values for quantization)
{v_1 : tensor} |= v_1 > 0
>>
Rule 9 (valid zero point values for quantization)
{v_1 : tensor} |= v_1 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 10 (input tensor must be non-empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0
